<title>UK: Abbey National sets 100 mln stg capped FRN.</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets 100 mln stg capped FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY SERVICES</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    18.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+15 BP    PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA2	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA	  REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> NOTES	**MAXIMUM COUPON 10 PCT</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
